# Load Balancing with Nginx

Most of the advice online assumes a team of fifty. For a solo project, a lot of it simply does not apply.

## Infrastructure

None of this is new, but having it written down in one place has saved me a surprising amount of time.

```nginx
upstream api {
  server api1:3000;
  server api2:3000;
}
```

